  <header class="p-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="breadcrumb p-in" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:26px;">
        <a href="/marketplace/">Marketplace</a><span>/</span><span>Cold Outreach Machine</span>
      </div>
      <span class="p-badge p-in s1">For sale &middot; Code licence</span>
      <h1>
        <span class="p-line"><span>Outreach that</span></span>
        <span class="p-line"><span class="thin">does its homework.</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="p-sub p-in s3">Scrape a niche, qualify the list, find one verifiable fact per business, and draft an email that proves you looked. Nothing sends itself — every draft waits in your mailbox for your approval.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions p-in s4">
        <a href="mailto:kevyn@kanaky.xyz?subject=Marketplace%20%E2%80%94%20Cold%20Outreach%20Machine" class="btn-primary">Get pricing</a>
        <a href="/marketplace/" class="btn-ghost">All systems</a>
      </div>
      <p class="p-price-hint p-in s5">Full source code &middot; setup guide &middot; handover call</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="p-stage">
    <div class="p-shot glow" style="margin:0 auto;max-width:900px;">
      <img src="/assets/products/cold-terminal.png" alt="Cold outreach pipeline running in a terminal" />
    </div>
    <p class="p-caption">A pipeline run on sample data — scrape, qualify, enrich, draft, arm the sequence.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="p-strip">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="p-stat pr d0"><b>1 fact</b><span>per email — a hook the prospect can verify</span></div>
      <div class="p-stat pr d1"><b>Draft-first</b><span>a human approves every single send</span></div>
      <div class="p-stat pr d2"><b>4 touches</b><span>sequenced follow-ups, stop-on-reply</span></div>
      <div class="p-stat pr d3"><b>Sorted</b><span>replies classified before you read them</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="p-features">
    <div class="p-feature">
      <div class="p-ftext pr">
        <span class="p-kicker">Personalisation at scale</span>
        <h2>Every email proves you looked.</h2>
        <p>The enricher reads each prospect's website and reviews and extracts one specific, verifiable observation — the buried emergency line, the unanswered reviews, the quote form going nowhere. That fact becomes the opening line. No “I hope this finds you well”.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Google Maps scraping by niche and region</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Dedupe, chain-filtering and no-contact removal built in</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Neutral example copy included — you rewrite it in your voice</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
    <div class="p-feature flip">
      <div class="p-ftext pr">
        <span class="p-kicker">Sequences</span>
        <h2>Follow-ups that know when to stop.</h2>
        <p>Four touches over two-and-a-half weeks, armed per prospect. The moment someone replies, their sequence stops — and the reply machine classifies the answer (interested, later, no) into a review dashboard before you even open it.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Stop-on-reply monitors the mailbox for you</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Daily batching keeps volume human-sized</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Reply dashboard: classified answers, one-click draft responses</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pr d1"><div class="p-timeline">
        <div class="p-tl-item done"><div class="p-tl-dot"></div><div class="p-tl-body"><b>Touch 1 — the researched opener</b><span>sent after your approval</span></div></div>
        <div class="p-tl-item done"><div class="p-tl-dot"></div><div class="p-tl-body"><b>Day 4 — short nudge</b><span>one new angle, three lines</span></div></div>
        <div class="p-tl-item"><div class="p-tl-dot"></div><div class="p-tl-body"><b>Day 9 — value follow-up</b><span>auto-skipped: prospect replied</span></div></div>
        <div class="p-tl-item"><div class="p-tl-dot"></div><div class="p-tl-body"><b>Day 16 — clean close</b><span>auto-skipped: sequence stopped</span></div></div>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="p-steps-wrap">
    <div class="p-steps-inner">
      <h2 class="pr">How it works, <span class="thin">start to finish.</span></h2>
      <div class="p-steps-grid">
        <div class="p-step pr d0"><span>01</span><h4>Point it at a niche</h4><p>“HVAC installers, Queensland” — the scraper builds and qualifies the list.</p></div>
        <div class="p-step pr d1"><span>02</span><h4>Approve the drafts</h4><p>Personalised drafts land in your mailbox. Edit, approve or bin each one.</p></div>
        <div class="p-step pr d2"><span>03</span><h4>Work the replies</h4><p>Sequences run themselves. Replies come back sorted by intent.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="p-specs">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="pr">
        <h3>Under the hood</h3>
        <div class="p-chips">
          <span>Node.js</span>
          <span>Playwright scraping</span>
          <span>LLM drafting (bring your own key)</span>
          <span>IMAP / SMTP</span>
          <span>Reply-classification dashboard</span>
          <span>Draft-first by design</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pr d1">
        <h3>What you get</h3>
        <ul class="p-included">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><b>Full source code</b> &mdash; the same system we run, scrubbed and documented</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><b>Setup guide</b> &mdash; step-by-step, from install to deployed</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><b>Handover call</b> &mdash; we get it running in your environment with you</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><b>Single-business licence</b> &mdash; agency licences available on request</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <h2 class="pr">Want it running for you?</h2>
    <p class="pr d1">Email the system name and your use case &mdash; you'll get a clear quote and a straight answer on whether it fits.</p>
    <div class="cta-actions pr d2">
      <a href="mailto:kevyn@kanaky.xyz?subject=Marketplace%20%E2%80%94%20Cold%20Outreach%20Machine" class="btn-primary">Get pricing</a>
      <a href="/marketplace/" class="btn-ghost">Back to marketplace</a>
    </div>
  </section>

